# Enforce LF in the working tree for all text files, on every platform.
#
# WHY THIS MATTERS HERE: the frozen-artifact guards (test_scorer_immutable,
# and later test_splits_immutable / test_detector_immutable) pin a sha256 of
# the file BYTES. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites LF->CRLF
# and silently changes every hash, making the guard fail on a byte-identical
# repo. eol=lf makes checkouts byte-identical everywhere so the pins hold.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts — never normalize.
*.pdf  binary
*.pptx binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.tif  binary
*.tiff binary
